HouseCat6D [16], Wild6D [11], and two larger-category benchmarks, Omni6DPose [36]
and PACE [35]. CAMERA25/REAL275 are the standard synthetic-to-real NOCS
benchmarks; HouseCat6D contains stronger occlusion and intra-class variation;

(1) DeepFashion [33], a fine-grained clothing dataset; (2) iNaturalist [56], with taxonomic labels;
(3) CIFAR-100 [27], grouped into superclasses; and (4) ModelNet40 [61], a 3D object classification
dataset. (5) BuImg [37], a breast cancer diagnosis ultrasound images dataset.

